[p004] What does stage 12 implement from the DSD? List the DSD procedures and the JS file that owns each one.
[p005] Find every place IOP-FTR-BLR-A103 is set. Cite JS file and line, and the DSD or general-rule line it comes from.
[p006] Search the DSD for how videoDuration is handled. Quote the branch. Do not infer from the ADD if the DSD already says it.
[p007] Read ADD §4.3 and tell me only what it says about session aggregation. If the ADD and the DSD disagree, say so in one line and keep the DSD as the behavior.
[p008] Is there a file naming pattern for the AMA output files in the DSD? If the DSD only hands the bytes to the distributor, say that and cite the call. Do not invent a pattern from the ADD.
[p009] Which file is authoritative for the sensor-id enrichment right now: interop/, interop-source/, or the deployed YAML? Say which one you read.
[p010] Show me the current _categories codes in interop/iopEnrichSensorId.js and interop/iopAggregationElig.js. Do not cite a renamed or deleted code as current.
[p011] Compare Lb_Filter in lb_mapping.dsd to iopFilterFresh.js. List only the divergences. One row each: title, DSD citation, JS citation, CONFIRMED/INFERRED/GAP/UNPROVEN, and one line on why it matters.
[p012] Does iopAggregationElig.js follow Lb_IsEligibleForAggregation, or did we put the check in the wrong stage? Say which stage owns it in the DSD and which stage owns it in the YAML.
[p013] This DSD branch drops records with an empty chargingId. Which IOP-FTR-* code is it, and is that code set in the JS? Cite both sides.
[p014] Walk this pCSCF final record through the DSD and then through the JS. Tell me the first branch where they disagree.
[p015] The JS skips the roaming check. Did the DSD skip it too? Quote the DSD. If the JS skip is not in the DSD, say so and stop.
[p016] Are the validation stage and the aggregation-eligibility stage applying the same record-type rule twice? Name the rule, both files, and which stage the DSD actually runs it in.
[p017] Sort the lb_mapping comparison in DSD source order so I can read the DSD beside it.
[p018] Check _recordingOfficeId on the recycled path. What does the DSD write, what does the JS write, and what does the YAML route on?
[p019] Read interop/pcscf_path/fresh-filter-algorithm.md and check the unit tests and E2E against it. List tests that assert the algorithm, and tests that assert a comment or an old variable name.
[p020] A local test passed for the sensor-id fix. Say what that proves and what is still UNPROVEN until a dev217 or dev116 log shows it.
[p021] Extract the aggregation algorithm from lb_mapping.dsd, compare it to iopSessionAggregation.js and the stage YAML, and append divergences to findings-aggregation.md. Flat list only.
[p022] Re-read finding AGG-07 against the current iopSessionAggregation.js. Mark it still open, resolved, or wrong, with the new line citation.
[p023] Finding FIL-03 needs a human decision. Add one sentence in the row and stop. Do not draft an email or an options table.
